# The reference for the printer: Alt-Help's screen dump of the desktop, as
# stock Hatari's printer port receives it (printer.out in the run folder). No
# cartridge: this is what the ST sends to a real printer. The AUTO test
# program holds the boot until Space (it drops the ESC sent for a Mega STE's
# memory test on other machines).
@hatari stock
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/autotest.st
wait 100
key 0x01
screen same autotest 1500
key 0x39
desktop 2500
keydown 0x38
key 0x62
keyup 0x38
printer 1000 4000
